('orlando-reunion-championsgate','Orlando: Reunion / ChampionsGate','Kissimmee, FL','FL',28.27,-81.60,
 'Best lodging product on the list, worst fit for the nature goal, and the wrong month. Eight- to twelve-bedroom villas with every bedroom en suite, private pools, game rooms and home theaters, plus resort water parks; inventory is deep and MCO is nonstop from all five origins, 30 minutes from the door. But there is no national park, June means mid-90s with a heat index over 100 and storms most afternoons, theme-park gates for 14 run four to seven thousand dollars before food, and the Florida family would be vacationing two hours from home.',
