('branson-table-rock','Branson / Table Rock Lake','Branson, MO','MO',36.64,-93.22,
 'Good 7- to 10-bedroom lodge inventory around Table Rock Lake and Silver Dollar City is a genuinely excellent theme park for a 2-to-11 age spread. Cheapest destination on the list. It ranks here because air access is poor: Springfield has essentially no nonstop service from Seattle, Nashville, Tampa or Fort Myers, so every flying family connects, which is exactly the outcome the Washington family asked us to avoid.',
